<title>INDIA: India allows extra 100,000 bales cotton exports.</title>
<headline>India allows extra 100,000 bales cotton exports.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Indian government allowed the Maharashtra State Cooperative Cotton Growers Marketing Federation Ltd to export an additional 100,000 bales of cotton, the Textiles Ministry said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
